1
00:00:00,196 --> 00:00:03,366
(Penny:)Okay, you've got my number.
Now give me the picture.

2
00:00:03,533 --> 00:00:05,283
All right. You drive a hard bargain...

3
00:00:05,826 --> 00:00:10,576
(Stuart:)- ...but here.
- All right. So, um, just give me a call.

4
00:00:13,334 --> 00:00:17,464
(Sheldon:)So Leonard, how are you enjoying
Anything Can Happen Thursday?

5
00:00:21,926 --> 00:00:25,306
(Sheldon:)Look at that. That's a dent.

6
00:00:26,264 --> 00:00:29,804
(Sheldon:)Thank you,
Howard "Ham-Fisted" Wolowitz.

7
00:00:32,979 --> 00:00:35,859
Did you shut the TV off
in the middle of the Deep Space Nine...

8
00:00:36,023 --> 00:00:40,153
...Star Trek: The Original Series
"Trouble With Tribbles" crossover episode?

9
00:00:41,487 --> 00:00:43,487
(Leonard:)Apparently so.

10
00:00:44,407 --> 00:00:46,487
(Sheldon:)Are you ill?

11
00:00:46,659 --> 00:00:48,119
(Penny:)No.

12
00:00:48,286 --> 00:00:49,826
(Sheldon:)All right.

13
00:00:49,996 --> 00:00:53,376
(Sheldon:)Then is it fair to say that you're
experiencing some emotional turmoil...

14
00:00:53,541 --> 00:00:56,171
(Sheldon:)...over the events involving Penny
earlier this evening?

15
00:00:56,669 --> 00:00:59,019
(Leonard:)When did you pick up on that?

